  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_01",
      "hash64": "F2613AE6987F3D40",
      "text": "第一个介绍牌……[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_02",
      "hash64": "F2613DE6987F4259",
      "text": "抱、抱歉，吓到你了？[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_03",
      "hash64": "F2613CE6987F40A6",
      "text": "我、我说过咧，\\n会远远地跟着你的……[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_04",
      "hash64": "F2613FE6987F45BF",
      "text": "是要读介绍牌的内容来着？[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_05",
      "hash64": "F2613EE6987F440C",
      "text": "啊，上面的内容我都知道，\\n……要读，你读吧。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_01",
      "hash64": "593E4E7F1481F725",
      "text": "相传在很久很久以前，\\n北上乡有非常可怕的鬼。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_02",
      "hash64": "593E4B7F1481F20C",
      "text": "鬼盘踞在村子的后山，\\n平时会吓唬进山的人。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_03",
      "hash64": "593E4C7F1481F3BF",
      "text": "有一天，鬼大发雷霆，突然下山，\\n让村民陷入恐慌。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_04",
      "hash64": "593E497F1481EEA6",
      "text": "此时够赞狗、愿增猿，\\n以及吉雉鸡刚巧在村里。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_05",
      "hash64": "593E4A7F1481F059",
      "text": "３只宝可梦拼上性命，\\n终于把鬼赶回山里。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_06",
      "hash64": "593E477F1481EB40",
      "text": "村民们把英勇的它们\\n亲切地称为宝伴。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_system_07",
      "hash64": "593E487F1481ECF3",
      "text": "还厚葬了它们的遗骸，\\n并在上面建造了宝伴的雕像。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_27",
      "hash64": "F25AD0E6987A1D74",
      "text": "……宝伴像\\n就在对面的广场里哦。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_06",
      "hash64": "F26141E6987F4925",
      "text": "话说回来，这个传说……\\n里面的鬼是不是很帅咧？[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "E2B4A8FA0E740A62",
      "text": "帅！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "E2B4A7FA0E7408AF",
      "text": "是吗……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_07",
      "hash64": "F26140E6987F4772",
      "text": "我就说咧！\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你太懂我了～！\\c\\n凭一己之力对抗多个敌人，\\n真哇呀帅咧！[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_08",
      "hash64": "F26143E6987F4C8B",
      "text": "啊～？\\n鬼可是连帮手都没有呀！\\c\\n它凭一己之力对抗多个敌人，\\n真哇呀帅咧！[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_09",
      "hash64": "F26142E6987F4AD8",
      "text": "啊……一般人会害怕的吧……？\\n不过，根本不用怕。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_10",
      "hash64": "F25DD5E6987C5BCA",
      "text": "我小时候可是一个人\\n在晚上去过山里好几次，\\r\\n却完全遇不到鬼哦。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_11",
      "hash64": "F25DD6E6987C5D7D",
      "text": "只落了个被大人哇哇数落的下场……[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_12",
      "hash64": "F25DD3E6987C5864",
      "text": "那个……\\n要和介绍牌拍照来着？[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_13",
      "hash64": "F25DD4E6987C5A17",
      "text": "我没有手机，\\n……能拜托你来拍吗？[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_14",
      "hash64": "F25DD1E6987C54FE",
      "text": "拍得真好看，\\n你好会拍啊……[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_select_03",
      "hash64": "E2B4A6FA0E7406FC",
      "text": "谢谢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_select_04",
      "hash64": "E2B4A5FA0E740549",
      "text": "要拍拍看吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_15",
      "hash64": "F25DD2E6987C56B1",
      "text": "抱、抱歉，\\n我可能太没分寸了……[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_16",
      "hash64": "F25DCFE6987C5198",
      "text": "抱、抱歉，\\n我不是那个意思。\\r\\n但是……下次……嗯。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_17",
      "hash64": "F25DD0E6987C534B",
      "text": "我本来是不想参加\\n夏令营这类活动的，\\r\\n但是好像……还有点意思。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_18",
      "hash64": "F25DCDE6987C4E32",
      "text": "不但能在乡里的大自然中溜达……\\n还能和[VAR 0x0100(0000)]你……说上话。[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_19",
      "hash64": "F25DCEE6987C4FE5",
      "text": "要、要是你想的话，\\n可以一起野餐，吃点三明治什么的……[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_legend_01",
      "hash64": "C57FC2B2E8C71875",
      "text": "啊嘎！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_20",
      "hash64": "F25ACFE6987A1BC1",
      "text": "啊呀！？啥、啥子！？\\n这、这是……怪兽！？[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_select_05a",
      "hash64": "ACF84BE68F22BCB5",
      "text": "故勒顿",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_select_05b",
      "hash64": "ACF848E68F22B79C",
      "text": "密勒顿",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_select_06",
      "hash64": "E2B4A3FA0E7401E3",
      "text": "坐骑宝可梦",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_21",
      "hash64": "F25ACEE6987A1A0E",
      "text": "故勒顿？坐骑宝可梦？\\n这样的宝可梦，\\r\\n我从来没见过……[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_22",
      "hash64": "F25ACDE6987A185B",
      "text": "密勒顿？坐骑宝可梦？\\n这样的宝可梦，\\r\\n我从来没见过……[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc01_side01_010_brother_23",
      "hash64": "F25ACCE6987A16A8",
      "text": "它是对三明治这个词\\n有反应才出来的……？[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
